			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 747030101,
					"content": "等等…這帳目…你們確定沒算錯？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						747030102
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「木偶」"
				},
				{
					"id": 747030102,
					"content": "嗯？有什麼問題嗎？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						747030103
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 747030103,
					"content": "…這賺得也太多了吧？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						747030104
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「木偶」"
				},
				{
					"id": 747030104,
					"content": "後悔只拿三成了？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						747030105
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 747030105,
					"content": "#我在{F#妳}{M#你}心中是那麼小氣的人嗎？我單純在感慨{F#妳}{M#你}們居然真的能把水族館經營得那麼好。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						747030106
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「木偶」"
				},
				{
					"id": 747030106,
					"content": "我覺得多少也有「千靈映影節」的功勞啦。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						747030107
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 747030107,
					"content": "這營業額…不只賺回了我租維恩歌萊號的錢，甚至還有很多盈餘。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						747030108
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「木偶」"
				},
				{
					"id": 747030108,
					"content": "想轉行了？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						747030109
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 747030109,
					"content": "那倒不至於，我知道自己不適合做生意。我還是對機械結構和術式研究更感興趣。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						747030110
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「木偶」"
				},
				{
					"id": 747030110,
					"content": "不過…也對，看著這地方從一條魚都沒有的房間，變成現在這副模樣，的確令人驚訝。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						747030111
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「木偶」"
				},
				{
					"id": 747030111,
					"content": "嘿嘿，這裡面也有桑多涅慷慨出借的功勞啦！自己裝點的房間被大家喜歡，還是很開心的對吧？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						747030112
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 747030112,
					"content": "哼，有那麼一點點吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						747030113
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「木偶」"
				},
				{
					"id": 747030113,
					"content": "只有一點點嗎？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						747030114
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 747030114,
					"content": "可能因為她只拿了三成。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						747030115
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 747030115,
					"content": "說了我不在意這個啦！！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "「木偶」"
				}
			]
		}
	]
